  "expirationDate": "2035-11-14",
  "historyNote": "#1689, eff 12-22-80; ss by #2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94 New. #8257, eff 1-15-05, EXPIRED: 1-15-13 New. #10310, INTERIM, eff 4-12-13, EXPIRES: 10-9-13; ss by #10567, eff 5-1-14, EXPIRED: 5-1-24 New. #14041, INTERIM, eff 8-2-24; ss by #14370, eff 11-14-25, EXPIRES: 11-14-35",
